-- add-no-terminal.txt --
AIGW  Action required
────────────────────────────────────────

Problem
  a Token is read from --token-stdin without a terminal or with --json; pipe the Token to `aigw provider add spare --endpoint responses=$UPSTREAM/spare/v1 --token-stdin`

Fix
  aigw provider add spare --endpoint responses=$UPSTREAM/spare/v1 --token-stdin
