Fix
  aigw provider edit spare --help
-- add-unavailable.txt --
AIGW  Action required
────────────────────────────────────────

Problem
  Token validation failed: Codex endpoint returned HTTP 503

Impact
  No Token was stored.

Fix
  aigw provider add spare --endpoint responses=$UPSTREAM/unavailable/v1 --token-stdin
-- rotate-rejected.txt --
AIGW  Action required
────────────────────────────────────────

Problem
  Token validation failed: Codex authentication was rejected (HTTP 401)

Impact
  No Token was stored; the previous Token is unchanged.

Fix
  aigw provider rotate spare --token-stdin
