-- edit-no-probe.txt --
AIGW  Action required
────────────────────────────────────────

Problem
  provider spare has no balance probe, so a balance token has no use

Evidence
  A team file sets a provider's balance probe; `aigw setup --from <file>` applies it.

Fix
  aigw config export
